<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Task Manager | CEO Dashboard' }) %>
<body class="bg-brand-bg text-brand-dark overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-brand-yellow/30">

<%- include('partials/navbar') %>

<main class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8">
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-1">
        <a href="/ceo" class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-dark rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-brand-yellow shadow-lg hover:bg-black transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 19.5 3 12m0 0 7.5-7.5M3 12h18" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-brand-dark uppercase">Task Manager</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-muted ml-1">All tasks across all ventures</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-muted">
        <span class="bg-brand-cream px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full"><%= openTasks %> open</span>
        <span class="bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full"><%= doneTasks %> done</span>
      </div>
      <a href="/ceo" class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-dark bg-brand-cream hover:bg-brand-yellow/20 px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors">← Dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Add task form -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-6 border border-brand-border/40 shadow-sm mb-8">
    <form id="ceoTaskForm" class="flex gap-3">
      <input id="ceoTaskInput" type="text" placeholder="Add a new task…" class="flex-1 rounded-xl border border-brand-border/40 bg-brand-cream/30 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark placeholder:text-brand-muted/50 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-yellow" />
      <select id="ceoTaskCol" class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border/40 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-brand-dark">
        <% taskColumns.forEach(function(c) { %>
        <option value="<%= c.id %>"><%= c.label %></option>
        <% }); %>
      </select>
      <button type="submit" class="bg-brand-dark text-brand-yellow px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-black transition-colors">Add Task</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <!-- Kanban Board -->
  <div class="flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto pb-4">
    <% taskColumns.forEach(function(col) { %>
    <div class="ceo-kanban-col min-w-[280px] w-[280px] shrink-0 flex flex-col gap-3" data-column="<%= col.id %>">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="background:<%= col.id === 'backlog' ? '#94a3b8' : col.id === 'todo' ? '#FFD644' : col.id === 'doing' ? '#3b82f6' : '#10b981' %>"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-dark"><%= col.label %></span>
        </div>
        <span class="ceo-col-count px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-cream text-[10px] font-bold text-brand-muted"><%= (tasksByColumn[col.id] || []).length %></span>
      </div>
      <ul class="ceo-kanban-list min-h-[200px] flex flex-col gap-3 p-3 bg-brand-cream/20 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-brand-border/30">
        <% (tasksByColumn[col.id] || []).forEach(function(t) { %>
        <li class="ceo-task-card p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border/20 shadow-sm cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing group hover:border-brand-yellow/40 transition-all" data-task-id="<%= t.id %>">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-dark leading-snug"><%= t.title %></p>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-3">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-brand-muted uppercase tracking-wider"><%= t.column %></span>
            <button type="button" class="ceo-task-del text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-rose-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity hover:underline">✕</button>
          </div>
        </li>
        <% }); %>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <% }); %>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sortablejs@1.15.0/Sortable.min.js"></script>
<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
  // ── Kanban Drag & Drop ──
  if (typeof Sortable !== 'undefined') {
    document.querySelectorAll('.ceo-kanban-list').forEach(function(ul) {
      Sortable.create(ul, {
        group: 'ceo-tasks',
        animation: 150,
        ghostClass: 'opacity-40',
        onEnd: function(evt) {
          var card = evt.item;
          var taskId = card.getAttribute('data-task-id');
          var toCol = evt.to.closest('.ceo-kanban-col');
          if (!taskId || !toCol) return;
          var newColumn = toCol.getAttribute('data-column');
          fetch('/tasks/api/' + encodeURIComponent(taskId), {
            method: 'PATCH',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ column: newColumn }),
          }).then(function(r) { return r.json(); }).then(function(d) {
            if (d.success) {
              document.querySelectorAll('.ceo-kanban-col').forEach(function(col) {
                var count = col.querySelectorAll('.ceo-task-card').length;
                var badge = col.querySelector('.ceo-col-count');
                if (badge) badge.textContent = count;
              });
            }
          }).catch(function(e) { console.error('Task move failed:', e); });
        }
      });
    });
  }

  // ── Add Task ──
  var taskForm = document.getElementById('ceoTaskForm');
  if (taskForm) {
    taskForm.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      var input = document.getElementById('ceoTaskInput');
      var colSelect = document.getElementById('ceoTaskCol');
      var title = (input.value || '').trim();
      if (!title) return;
      fetch('/tasks/api', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ title: title, column: colSelect.value || 'todo' }),
      }).then(function(r) { return r.json(); }).then(function(d) {
        if (d.success && d.task) {
          input.value = '';
          var col = document.querySelector('.ceo-kanban-col[data-column="' + d.task.column + '"] .ceo-kanban-list');
          if (col) {
            var li = document.createElement('li');
            li.className = 'ceo-task-card p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border/20 shadow-sm cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing group hover:border-brand-yellow/40 transition-all';
            li.setAttribute('data-task-id', d.task.id);
            li.innerHTML = '<p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-dark leading-snug">' + escapeHtml(d.task.title) + '</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-3"><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-brand-muted uppercase tracking-wider">' + d.task.column + '</span><button type="button" class="ceo-task-del text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-rose-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity hover:underline">✕</button></div>';
            col.appendChild(li);
            var badge = col.closest('.ceo-kanban-col').querySelector('.ceo-col-count');
            if (badge) badge.textContent = col.querySelectorAll('.ceo-task-card').length;
            attachDelHandler(li.querySelector('.ceo-task-del'));
          }
        }
      }).catch(function(e) { console.error('Add task failed:', e); });
    });
  }

  // ── Delete Task ──
  function attachDelHandler(btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
      var card = btn.closest('.ceo-task-card');
      var taskId = card.getAttribute('data-task-id');
      if (!taskId) return;
      fetch('/tasks/api/' + encodeURIComponent(taskId), { method: 'DELETE' })
        .then(function(r) { return r.json(); })
        .then(function(d) {
          if (d.success) {
            var col = card.closest('.ceo-kanban-col');
            card.remove();
            if (col) {
              var badge = col.querySelector('.ceo-col-count');
              if (badge) badge.textContent = col.querySelectorAll('.ceo-task-card').length;
            }
          }
        }).catch(function(e) { console.error('Delete task failed:', e); });
    });
  }
  document.querySelectorAll('.ceo-task-del').forEach(attachDelHandler);

  function escapeHtml(s) {
    var d = document.createElement('div');
    d.textContent = s;
    return d.innerHTML;
  }
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
